    "whatDoes": "• <strong>14 agentes:</strong> conductor + 13 specialists (planner, architect, coder, writer, code-review, security-review, database-review, tdd-guide, build-fix, e2e-tester, documentation, refactorer, git-specialist)<br>• <strong>Delegação obrigatória:</strong> conductor tem write/edit <strong>negados</strong> na permissão + hook <code>tool.execute.before</code> bloqueia bash redirects. Toda mudança deve passar por coder/writer/tdd-guide/git-specialist<br>• <strong>First-tool gate:</strong> regras duras no topo do prompt + routing table + few-shot com contrastes certo/errado<br>• <strong>Slash commands:</strong> /plan, /tdd, /security, /code-review<br>• <strong>Always-on skills:</strong> Socratic design, security review, coding standards, git workflow, CodeMemory-first<br>• <strong>Plugins:</strong> ECC hooks (Prettier + tsc on save), continuous-learning v2 (homunculus instinct store), worktree spawner, auto-compact, caveman ultra, Figma RAG, macOS notifications, bootstrap<br>• <strong>Custom tools:</strong> run-tests, check-coverage, security-audit, codemap generator<br>• <strong>Claude Code mirror</strong> (.claude/): hooks, rules, skills, homunculus compartilhado<br>• <strong>Env vars:</strong> OPENCODE_MODEL_PRIMARY, OPENCODE_MODEL_SUBAGENT_PLANNER, etc<br>• One-line: <code>curl -fsSL ... | bash</code>",
